<p>Send a surge of power into all turrets in sight, extending their duration by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 3, 3, 4</acronym> turns and granting them a charged shield absorbing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>steampower 100">379, 510, 612, 698, 774</acronym> damage for 10 turns. While the shield holds, each turn the turret will project a bolt of lightning dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>steampower 100">59, 79, 95, 108, 120</acronym> lightning damage to a random enemy in radius 6, with a 25% chance to daze.</p><p>The effects will increase with your Steampower.</p>